+  "status": "AUTHORIZED",
+  "note": "WP-VAL-B, the second rung of the badf-release-validation ladder frozen at #209 / WP-2026-0107. Four typed G09 evidence schemas (quality-validation, security-validation, performance-test, resilience-test) plus an additive check_g09_binding in the canonical gate, mirroring VER-B's G08 rung. Strictly additive: binding-less G09 objects stay admissible. No scripts/badf_release_validation.py (VAL-I20 holds at every rung), no lifecycle change. Shared-surface -> BADF-QA + BADF-REV. Lands AUTHORIZED with no learning declared, inheriting #220's unreachable-guard pattern -- declared, not tidied."
